    <p>What that means practically for LA service: Lang sits inside the same Middleby Corporation portfolio as Pitco (commercial fryers, via Blodgett 1981 acquisition chain), Blodgett (deck and conveyor pizza ovens), Southbend (commercial ranges), TurboChef (rapid cook ovens), Wells (built-in cooking equipment), Bakers Pride (pizza ovens and charbroilers), MagiKitch'n (charbroilers), Star and Toastmaster, APW Wyott (toasting and holding equipment), and Imperial Commercial Cooking Equipment. For LA kitchens running multi-Middleby equipment configurations, one service relationship covers the full sibling list.</p>
