    <p>LA install base concentrates in two operational segments. <strong>Hotel banquet kitchens:</strong> Ritz-Carlton DTLA, Four Seasons Beverly Hills, Waldorf Astoria Beverly Hills, JW Marriott LA Live, Conrad Los Angeles — Mini-Rack roasters running daily banquet production cycles. <strong>Country clubs:</strong> Bel-Air Country Club, Los Angeles Country Club, Hillcrest Country Club, Riviera Country Club — Mini-Rack at the heart of country-club kitchen banquet service infrastructure, where wedding and event roasting volume varies week-to-week but always demands the same equipment reliability.</p>
    <p>Primary Mini-Rack service items: drive motor at year 6 to 9 ($380 to $580), cart guide wear at year 5 to 8 ($240 to $380), heating element / burner refurbish at year 7 to 10 ($340 to $520), door gasket replacement at year 4 to 6 ($150 to $280), thermostat replacement ($200 to $340). Drive motor and cart guide service are Lang-specific service expertise — most general-purpose commercial appliance services don't carry these parts or know the Mini-Rack drive architecture. We do.</p>
    <p>When a Mini-Rack drive motor fails the night before a 400-cover wedding, equipment substitution isn't operationally feasible — repair has to happen tonight. We dispatch to country-club and hotel banquet Mini-Rack emergencies regularly, and same-visit resolution is the standard service expectation in this segment.</p>
